## 8. Performance Requirements

### 8.1 Core Web Vitals Targets
- **LCP**: < 1.5s (optimized for local-only app)
- **FID**: < 100ms
- **CLS**: < 0.1
- **FCP**: < 1.0s

### 8.2 Application Performance
- **Initial Load**: < 2s to interactive
- **Item Operations**: < 100ms response time
- **List Switching**: < 200ms transition
- **Search/Filter**: < 50ms for up to 1000 items

### 8.3 Memory Usage
- **Maximum Items**: Support up to 10,000 items across all lists
- **Memory Footprint**: < 50MB in browser
- **Storage Limit**: < 5MB localStorage usage

